# ---- Squares, files and ranks (spoken) -----------------------------------------------------------
# File letters by their Finnish names, as Finnish players read notation: e4 = "ee neljä", f3 = "äf
# kolme", a8 = "aa kahdeksan", h7 = "hoo seitsemän", c5 = "see viisi". Never put a case ending on a
# square ({sq}:ään, {sq}:ssa): it is said differently each time. Inflect a noun next to it instead:
# "ruutuun {sq}" (to), "ruudussa {sq}" (on), "ruudusta {sq}" (from), "ruutu {sq}", "ruudun {sq}".
